<html>

<head>
    <title>Characters</title>
    <link href="style.css" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>

<body>
    {# nav bar #}
    {% include "navigation.njk" %}
    {# Character images #}
    <div class="all-characters">
        <div class="character-intro">
            <img src="/images/anxiety.PNG" />
            <div class="character-text">
                <h4>Anxiety</h4>
                <p>Lives at: the Convenience Store</p>
                <p>Anxiety never really sleeps. You'll find them sitting in the convenience store long after midnight,
                    thinking about every single detail of their lives. Often stying up late reflecting if they do
                    something wrong today.</p>
                <p>Personality: careful, restless</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="character-intro">
            <div class="character-text">
                <h4>Calm</h4>
                <p>Lives at: the River</p>
                <p>Calm spends most days sitting by the water, watching the current go by. When
                    everyone else is in panic, Calm is the one who still stay organized and patient.</p>
                <p>Personality: steady, patient</p>
            </div>
            <img src="/images/calm.PNG" />
        </div>

        <div class="character-intro">
            <img src="/images/joy.PNG" />
            <div class="character-text">
                <h4>Joy</h4>
                <p>Lives at: the Theme Park</p>
                <p>Joy can't sit still. They're always the ones who laugh the loudest and pull everyone else along. Joy
                    loves telling jokes around.</p>
                <p>Personality: chaotic, optimistic</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="character-intro">
            <div class="character-text">
                <h4>Anger</h4>
                <p>Lives at: the Tower</p>
                <p>Anger lives at the very top of the tower, where they can see everything and everyone. They need a
                    place for them to let off steam. They're loud and easily irritated, especially when they disagree
                    with something.</p>
                <p>Personality: fiery, direct</p>
            </div>
            <img src="/images/anger.PNG" />
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>